    <h1 style="color:#2c3e50; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:20pt; border-bottom:2px solid #34495e; padding-bottom:6px; margin-top:24px;">HomeForge AI: Premium Interior Design & Floor Plan Editor</h1>
<h2 style="color:#16a085; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:15pt; margin-top:20px; border-bottom:1px solid #eee; padding-bottom:4px;">Final Project Documentation & Technical Report Outline</h2>
